  "limits": [
    "Native-schema fixtures are not a vendor-version distribution benchmark; no universal platform classification accuracy is claimed.",
    "Only Visium and Slide-seq have fresh full real-native audits in this round; earlier BMK/MOSTA results are not reclassified as new samples.",
    "Seq-Scope is direct-only; Open-ST has no dedicated native automatic reader in this revision.",
    "read_stereoseq remains a known-platform automatic wrapper, so its route equality alone does not establish implementation independence; legacy read_bgi is tested separately.",
    "Direct legacy defaults can select Gene Expression features or use bin centroids; comparisons respect these explicitly tested semantics.",
    "Optional asset paths/keys and budget policies differ; complete equality of arbitrary uns metadata is not claimed.",
    "Complex multi-frame rasters, all optional boundary/transcript/segmentation fields and biological correctness are not exhaustively tested."
  ],
  "iteration_notes": [
